{"id": "508774", "name": "Q1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מערכת המורכבת מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(4\\)</span> רכיבים חשמליים כפי שמתואר בתרשים הבא:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"data/508774/files/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"887\" height=\"180\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"></p><p>נסמן את זמן החיים של הרכיב מספר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span> במשתנה מקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_i\\)</span>. ידוע ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[X_1\\sim{\\rm{Exp}}({{CT:0}}), \\hspace{5pt} X_2\\sim{\\rm{Exp}}({{CT:1}}), \\hspace{5pt} X_3\\sim{\\rm{Exp}}({{CT:2}}), \\hspace{5pt} X_4\\sim{\\rm{Exp}}({{CT:3}}) \\]</p><p>נניח כי המשתנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_1,X_2,X_3,X_4\\)</span> בלתי-תלויים. נסמן ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\( X \\)</span> זמן החיים של המערכת. (כדי שהמערכת תפעל צריך שיפעל רכיב 4 בכל מקרה, וכן יפעל רכיב 1 או רכיבים 2,3 יחד)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span>. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F_X(t)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "checkbox", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "LaTeXdisplaystyle"}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "tr:subsetp(setify(ans1),setify(mcq_correct(ta)));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "tr", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["f1", "f2", "f3", "f4", "la1", "la2", "la3", "la4", "q", "ta", "tam"], "nvariants": 50}